PASSWORD GENERATOR
A simple PYTHON program which generates random password based on the length entered by the user
FEATURES -----> Generates the password according to the ASCII letters, includes numbers, letters and special characters
HOW TO RUN IT:
-> Download password_generator.py
-> Make sure the PYTHON interpreter is present in the system
-> Download and run the program in the PYTHON
DOWNLOAD:
Click on password_generator.py -> Download raw file -> run it in PYTHON
LANGUAGE: PYTHON
